{
  "version": "stillpoint-calendar-core-spec-v1",
  "status": "stable-domain-spec",
  "engineeringInvariant": "The week governs sequence. The ordinary calendar governs address. The Sun governs seasonal correction. The Moon and seasons provide evidence. Publication gives finite civic coordinates. Jubilee governs a larger release count. None of them owns the others.",
